{"id":"vd-a2-the-bike-repair-shop","level":"a2","n":15,"title":{"en":"I'm Afraid There's a Problem","vi":"Tôi e là có chuyện rồi"},"summary":"Ông Grant quay lại tiệm với cánh tay băng bó vì phanh xe bị lỏng; chú Ray lắng nghe, còn Diego phải nhận lỗi.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-bike-repair-shop","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Bike Repair Shop","vi":"Tiệm sửa xe đạp"}},"scene":{"background":"street","props":[{"id":"bike","x":800,"y":760}]},"cast":{"grant":{"name":{"en":"Mr. Grant","vi":"Ông Grant"},"look":"man","x":1180,"style":{"hair":"bald","skin":"#E9B896","skinShade":"#D49E7A","outfit":"jacket","top":"#6B7F9E","topShade":"#56698A"}},"ray":{"name":{"en":"Uncle Ray","vi":"Chú Ray"},"look":"dad","x":520,"style":{"skin":"#B07650","skinShade":"#94603E","outfit":"apron","top":"#3A8E8B","topShade":"#2D7673"}},"diego":{"name":{"en":"Diego","vi":"Diego"},"look":"teenboy","x":280,"style":{"skin":"#B07650","skinShade":"#94603E","hair":"curly","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","outfit":"tee","top":"#E9A23B","topShade":"#D18B28"},"from":6}},"lines":[{"speaker":"grant","en":"Good morning. I'm afraid there's a problem with my bike.","vi":"Chào anh. Tôi e là chiếc xe của tôi có vấn đề.","ipa":["ɡʊd","ˈmɔɹnɪŋ","aɪm","əˈfɹeɪd","ðɛɹz","ə","ˈpɹɑbləm","wɪð","maɪ","baɪk"],"start":0.554,"end":4.314,"expression":"angry","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.672],[2,2.117],[3,2.334],[4,2.782],[5,2.973],[6,3.054],[7,3.503],[8,3.666],[9,3.829]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. What happened?","vi":"Ôi, tôi rất tiếc. Chuyện gì vậy ạ?","ipa":["oʊ","aɪm","ˈsɑɹi","tu","hiɹ","ðæt","wʌt","ˈhæpənd"],"start":5.104,"end":8.434,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,5.104],[1,5.553],[2,5.735],[3,6.061],[4,6.139],[5,6.373],[6,7.586],[7,7.899]]},{"speaker":"grant","en":"Your assistant repaired the brakes on Friday.","vi":"Cậu phụ việc của anh sửa phanh cho tôi hôm thứ Sáu.","ipa":["jɔɹ","əˈsɪstənt","ɹɪˈpɛɹd","ðə","bɹeɪks","ɑn","ˈfɹaɪdi"],"start":9.224,"end":11.524,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,9.224],[1,9.373],[2,9.916],[3,10.338],[4,10.433],[5,10.827],[6,10.99]]},{"speaker":"grant","en":"On Saturday, they didn't work, and I fell at a traffic light.","vi":"Sang thứ Bảy, phanh không ăn, và tôi bị ngã ngay ở đèn giao thông.","ipa":["ɑn","ˈsætɚdi","ðeɪ","ˈdɪdənt","wɝk","ənd","aɪ","fɛl","æt","ə","ˈtɹæfɪk","laɪt"],"start":12.064,"end":15.754,"expression":"angry","timing":[[0,12.064],[1,12.223],[2,13.12],[3,13.269],[4,13.554],[5,14.193],[6,14.315],[7,14.424],[8,14.777],[9,14.859],[10,14.927],[11,15.402]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"Oh no! Are you OK?","vi":"Ôi không! Anh có sao không?","ipa":["oʊ","noʊ","ɑɹ","ju","oʊˈkeɪ"],"start":16.544,"end":19.164,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,16.544],[1,16.716],[2,18.125],[3,18.372],[4,18.581]]},{"speaker":"grant","en":"My arm hurts, but I'll live.","vi":"Tay tôi đau, nhưng không chết được.","ipa":["maɪ","ɑɹm","hɝts","bʌt","aɪl","lɪv"],"start":19.954,"end":22.004,"expression":"angry","timing":[[0,19.954],[1,20.181],[2,20.453],[3,21.213],[4,21.404],[5,21.58]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"Let me have a look at the bike.","vi":"Để tôi xem chiếc xe.","ipa":["lɛt","mi","hæv","ə","lʊk","æt","ðə","baɪk"],"start":22.794,"end":24.284,"expression":"thinking","gesture":"point","prop":"bike","timing":[[0,22.794],[1,22.983],[2,23.139],[3,23.321],[4,23.412],[5,23.66],[6,23.764],[7,23.907]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"Hmm. This brake is loose. That's dangerous.","vi":"Ừm. Phanh bên này bị lỏng. Nguy hiểm thật.","ipa":["hm","ðɪs","bɹeɪk","ɪz","lus","ðæts","ˈdeɪndʒɚəs"],"start":24.824,"end":29.444,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,24.824],[1,26.062],[2,26.375],[3,26.713],[4,26.896],[5,28.289],[6,28.68]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"Mr. Grant… it was my fault.","vi":"Bác Grant… đó là lỗi của cháu.","ipa":["ˈmɪstɚ","ɡɹænt","ɪt","wɑz","maɪ","fɔlt"],"start":30.234,"end":32.724,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,30.234],[1,30.501],[2,31.669],[3,31.819],[4,31.995],[5,32.199]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"There were a lot of customers, and I didn't check it twice.","vi":"Hôm đó đông khách quá, và cháu đã không kiểm tra lại.","ipa":["ðɛɹ","wɝ","ə","lɑt","ʌv","ˈkʌstəmɚz","ənd","aɪ","ˈdɪdənt","tʃɛk","ɪt","twaɪs"],"start":33.264,"end":36.274,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,33.264],[1,33.361],[2,33.497],[3,33.579],[4,33.837],[5,33.959],[6,34.734],[7,34.965],[8,35.073],[9,35.331],[10,35.603],[11,35.712]]},{"speaker":"grant","en":"Well… at least you're honest.","vi":"Chà… ít ra cậu cũng thành thật.","ipa":["wɛl","æt","list","jʊɹ","ˈɑnəst"],"start":37.064,"end":38.764,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,37.064],[1,37.59],[2,37.753],[3,38.038],[4,38.215]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"We'll repair it right now, and you don't have to pay.","vi":"Chúng tôi sẽ sửa ngay bây giờ, và anh không phải trả tiền.","ipa":["wil","ɹɪˈpɛɹ","ɪt","ɹaɪt","naʊ","ənd","ju","doʊnt","hæv","tu","peɪ"],"start":39.554,"end":42.244,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,39.554],[1,39.75],[2,40.166],[3,40.27],[4,40.518],[5,41.013],[6,41.182],[7,41.312],[8,41.533],[9,41.703],[10,41.846]]},{"speaker":"diego","en":"And I'll test it three times on the street.","vi":"Và cháu sẽ chạy thử ba lần trên phố ạ.","ipa":["ənd","aɪl","tɛst","ɪt","θɹi","taɪmz","ɑn","ðə","stɹit"],"start":43.034,"end":45.274,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,43.034],[1,43.138],[2,43.328],[3,43.722],[4,43.858],[5,44.143],[6,44.619],[7,44.782],[8,44.877]]},{"speaker":"grant","en":"Thank you. That's all I wanted.","vi":"Cảm ơn. Tôi chỉ cần có vậy.","ipa":["θæŋk","ju","ðæts","ɔl","aɪ","ˈwɔntɪd"],"start":46.064,"end":48.704,"expression":"neutral","timing":[[0,46.064],[1,46.271],[2,47.539],[3,47.851],[4,48.082],[5,48.164]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"Please take this new helmet, too. It's a gift.","vi":"Anh nhận chiếc mũ bảo hiểm mới này nữa nhé. Quà của tiệm.","ipa":["pliz","teɪk","ðɪs","nu","ˈhɛlmət","tu","ɪts","ə","ɡɪft"],"start":49.494,"end":53.044,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,49.494],[1,49.693],[2,49.94],[3,50.161],[4,50.344],[5,50.877],[6,52.208],[7,52.468],[8,52.572]]},{"speaker":"grant","en":"Now that's good customer service!","vi":"Thế mới là phục vụ khách hàng tốt chứ!","ipa":["naʊ","ðæts","ɡʊd","ˈkʌstəmɚ","ˈsɝvəs"],"start":53.834,"end":55.784,"expression":"happy","react":{"diego":"happy","ray":"happy"},"timing":[[0,53.834],[1,54.088],[2,54.373],[3,54.645],[4,55.134]]}],"words":[{"id":"repair","en":"repair","ipa":"ɹɪˈpɛɹ","vi":"sửa chữa; việc sửa chữa","level":1},{"id":"brake","en":"brake","ipa":"bɹeɪk","vi":"phanh; thắng xe","level":1},{"id":"customer","en":"customer","ipa":"ˈkʌstəmɚ","vi":"khách hàng","level":1},{"id":"loose","en":"loose","ipa":"lus","vi":"lỏng; rộng thùng thình; thả ra","level":1},{"id":"fault","en":"fault","ipa":"fɔlt","vi":"lỗi; khuyết điểm; đứt gãy","level":1},{"id":"check","en":"check","ipa":"tʃɛk","vi":"kiểm tra; sự kiểm tra; séc","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Phàn nàn lịch sự và xử lý phàn nàn","pattern":"I'm afraid there's a problem with… · I'm sorry to hear that. · Let me have a look. · It was my fault. · We'll…","explain":"Khách phàn nàn lịch sự bắt đầu bằng \"I'm afraid…\" (e là…). Người bán đáp \"I'm sorry to hear that\", xem xét (\"Let me have a look\") và đưa giải pháp bằng \"We'll…\". Nhận lỗi: \"It was my fault.\"","keys":["i'm afraid","i'm sorry to hear that","let me have a look","it was my fault","we'll"],"lines":[0,1,6,8,11]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-bike-repair-shop.mp3","v":"d69d9e1a74","duration":56.88,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}